VT-03: involves → HV-04, HV-05; bounds → F2; tested-by → UC01-F2-CL1, UC01-F2-CL4.

VT-04: involves → HV-02, HV-04; bounds → F2; strained-by → TECH-01; tested-by → UC01-F2-CL5.

VT-05: involves → HV-01, HV-05; bounds → F1, F2; strained-by → TECH-02; tested-by → UC01-F2-PR2, UC01-F2-CL4.

VT-06: involves → HV-01, HV-05; bounds → UC02 (later cycle).

VT-07: involves → HV-04, HV-06; bounds → F2, F3; tested-by → UC01-F3-CL9.